cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this guest, cite the guest API it builds against.
title: bake.elf -- alpha culling and texture atlases for avatar meshes (sandbox guest)
abstract: >-
  The CPU part of RFD 2284's bake stage. The host passes UVs, indices and
  RGBA8 pixels; the guest returns the triangles a cutout or blended material
  would hide, and one shelf-packed atlas per mesh with the UVs moved into it.
  The guest has no filesystem, sockets or host objects. Split out of
  interactor-remesh at 610e7eb, where alpha_cull and the atlas first lived.
type: software
authors:
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
license: MIT
